ents and even angered the  strongest creature in the world to do it  however they failed to stop him from  awakening despite their best efforts  luffy awakened and we all found out that  he didn't have the gum gum fruit but  rather he had the mythical zone sun god  nika fruit the most ridiculous power in  the world to quote the world government  just the legend of nika alone was enough  to make a jail guard who was talking  about the sun god disappear who's who  remembers that nika was a figure that  slaves would pray to in the long distant  past a legendary warrior they believed  would one day free them they thought  he'd bring smiles to their faces and  deliver them from suffering who's who as  different from luffy and his friends as  he is even admitted to clinging to the  legend of nikka because prison felt so  endless such a unifying figure for  slaves and the oppressed is the world  government's worst nightmare and even  the story was enough to make who's whose  jailer disappear and to make him fear  for his own life he feared that they'd  make him disappear so much that he  risked it all to escape and that's how  he ended up joining kaido's crew since  even knowing about the legend is deadly  then having a living and breathing sun  god nika in luffy giving hope strength  and even assistance to downtrodden is  probably the biggest threat that the  world government has ever encountered  with his cartoonish fruit luffy can  straight up do the impossible or in  other words make miracles happen which  is sure to further inspire the people  that the world government rules over to  rise up roger couldn't be such a threat  because he didn't have this fruit he  also knew that he was too early so at  some point he probably decided to leave  the world government to do what they  were doing for his lifetime at least  trusting that another would take care of  it in fact goldie roger teamed up with  monkey d garp and the marines to help  protect nobles from rox d zebek at 